{"data": [{"author_id": "2110386666061832192", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:27:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122320683401433418"], "id": "2122320683401433418", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1762175022527877120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122093886961270885", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kr0der Catching them before they renew is the clever bit, not after the charge lands. Ray had Grok Bot list every recurring charge in his inbox, then track the cancellations: $121/mo saved https://t.co/Z0VdGNVuHT How much warning does yours give you?", "url": "https://x.com/agentsinuse/status/2122320683401433418"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122317922471153664"]}, "author_id": "1116182706", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:26:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122320518044959080"], "id": "2122320518044959080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117732251760996831", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Holy f*ck. Claude Code creator Boris Cherny:\n\n“My job is to write loops.”\n\nBoris went from writing code with autocomplete to running several Claude sessions in parallel. Now he writes workflows that decide what to ask Claude next.\n\nIn this 29-minute Acquired interview, he gives a https://t.co/RGeLJ1MJ1j https://t.co/j3RuW7XZnC", "url": "https://x.com/rcyxbt/status/2122320518044959080"}, {"author_id": "2093017963821690880", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:24:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122319921119998097"], "id": "2122319921119998097", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2093017963821690880", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122316130840625153", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@withpersona My @united flight was delayed 4hrs this morning, which meant missing my connection to Singapore for #SFF2026\n\n@hark_labs flagged it right away and suggested a new flight that wasn't even an option in the United app. Nice proactive move.\n\nThen my Grok @bot called United at 4:30am,", "url": "https://x.com/DavidChachanko/status/2122319921119998097"}, {"author_id": "1613054589464444930", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:13:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122317127050727618"], "id": "2122317127050727618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/\nhow to stop answering the same customer questions\n\nA Grok Bot can check your inbox on a schedule and draft the replies in Gmail or Outlook. You press Send.\n\nthe play: write the answers &gt; connect Gmail or Outlook &gt; the bot drafts, you send", "url": "https://x.com/grokdeploy/status/2122317127050727618"}, {"article": {"title": "How to choose the AI agent to trust with your digital life"}, "author_id": "3108019343", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:12:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122316957714096369"], "id": "2122316957714096369", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1029, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "https://t.co/OOmHBZx9jh", "url": "https://x.com/KSimback/status/2122316957714096369"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122315283578929152"]}, "author_id": "1765334068235739136", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:11:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122316601450242268"], "id": "2122316601450242268", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok bot can book your flights now.\n\nAdd @lanatools to it and it'll find and book your flight with @brij_fi \n\nPlug it in: https://t.co/IU4CCjLU2k https://t.co/bT80HWHV5s", "url": "https://x.com/lanatools/status/2122316601450242268"}, {"author_id": "1708283782996856832", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:03:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122314734200344838"], "id": "2122314734200344838", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 186, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "So far this month with AI... I\n\n- Increased our lead volume by 4x entering what was typically our slowest time of the year\n- Automated OSHA safety training and compliance tracking\n- Made an email newsletter that even non leads / customers are signing up for because they want to", "url": "https://x.com/bprintco/status/2122314734200344838"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122314689606516736"]}, "author_id": "2015703340563447808", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:03:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122314730232529148"], "id": "2122314730232529148", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 529, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2101661510091034926", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "F*ck YES... Elon Musk's team just made United useless\n\nGrok Bot makes phone calls now, and since Thursday on Mac it reads your Mail and Calendar too\n\nSo the second United emails \"your flight was cancelled\", it's already on hold asking for your cash back\n\n6 Thanksgiving calls I'm https://t.co/t6Nr54MFJc https://t.co/ocw6kvbhaN", "url": "https://x.com/0xjmori/status/2122314730232529148"}, {"author_id": "259062581", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:58:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122313258397040737"], "id": "2122313258397040737", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122164224382447808", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot I'm waiting for the day when elon's robot optimus will work closely with grok bot and build these rickets independently and manage our flights to Mars and other places in space. @grok  what do you think with current progress or pace when can we see this on ground?", "url": "https://x.com/uditkrgarg/status/2122313258397040737"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122310037196742657"]}, "author_id": "2108819820770975745", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:45:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122310138929488188"], "id": "2122310138929488188", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot @bot tops our inbox test with 96.3. ChatGPT dots @ChatGPT scored 94.1, Instinct @instinct 91.2 and Muse @Muse 86.9.\n\nThe gap is redo work. Grok Bot's first answer did the whole job on 56 of 72 tasks. Muse's did on 32. https://t.co/WijlJTqKlR", "url": "https://x.com/AnalystAIlab/status/2122310138929488188"}, {"author_id": "1795629387162767360", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:27:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122305489039950167"], "id": "2122305489039950167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122230356648886442", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I want to set the record straight about SpaceX's Starship Flight 15.\n\nOn Friday, November 13, Starship lifted off from Starbase, Texas. The Super Heavy booster did not make it back to the tower. It ran low on fuel, aborted the catch on its own, hovered over the Gulf of Mexico, https://t.co/cLNW2UTidI", "url": "https://x.com/Hoppy1947a/status/2122305489039950167"}, {"author_id": "112808447", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:16:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122302838990929933"], "id": "2122302838990929933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122061360960086336", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot is becoming the only AI tool I am talking to regularly. It's doing everything for me, starting with:\n- managing my inbox\n- managing my task list\n- managing my finances\n- handling my follow-ups\n- recording my transcripts\n- doing marketing for us\n- software development\n- https://t.co/DTsZIreYTE", "url": "https://x.com/kunalbhusare/status/2122302838990929933"}, {"article": {"title": "Exercise 003: services as software, applied to our own engineering"}, "author_id": "148911816", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:06:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122300229135237504"], "id": "2122300229135237504", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 166, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Exercise 003: services as software, applied to how we build our Agentic Marketing Platform®. @DevinAI on SWE-2 codes, a cross-provider council reviews. 1 in 5 merged changes had a NOT CLEAN comment. @cognition @wearejam7 https://t.co/HQsMWwaStX", "url": "https://x.com/nathanluxford/status/2122300229135237504"}, {"article": {"title": "It's Not Sanctions. It's Unit Economics."}, "author_id": "1455334915", "created_at": "2026-11-16T12:03:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122299477952254371"], "id": "2122299477952254371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 148, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/RWN5gSyuWx", "url": "https://x.com/andilejaden/status/2122299477952254371"}, {"author_id": "2007945971788021760", "created_at": "2026-11-16T11:59:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122298485764403657"], "id": "2122298485764403657", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2007945971788021760", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122298278888817121", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@QuantumPionier @theo Probably less needed in the future as more of my workflow goes headless using things like Grok bot, but it is still good to know that I can go in and see things at a bird’s eye view relative to the project rather than just endless streams of chats. I have to keep things unread,", "url": "https://x.com/builtbysketch/status/2122298485764403657"}, {"article": {"title": "I told two AI assistants I was happy to pay. They mostly talked me out of it."}, "author_id": "2029705395405737986", "created_at": "2026-11-16T11:41:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122293881744003349"], "id": "2122293881744003349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 69, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/60CF3GZAed", "url": "https://x.com/aioli3_/status/2122293881744003349"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122293308177158144"]}, "author_id": "1614958779489026048", "created_at": "2026-11-16T11:38:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122293346177605778"], "id": "2122293346177605778", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 111, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My inbox gets 20+ emails a day from websites I never visited.\n\nThey're backlinks. My Grok bot signed up for them.\n\n@grok how many dofollow backlinks does a new SaaS need before Google starts sending real traffic?\n\nIn two weeks, two of my bots found 67 dofollow backlinks and 2 https://t.co/d6Boz2eBd3", "url": "https://x.com/0xPaulvibe/status/2122293346177605778"}, {"author_id": "1711297245784772608", "created_at": "2026-11-16T11:37:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122293035815866605"], "id": "2122293035815866605", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot can now read your iMessages, your Apple Mail, Notes, Reminders, Calendar, Location, and Contacts.\n\nSeven Apple built-in apps just got official Grok connectors.\n\nvia @testingcatalog", "url": "https://x.com/auignatenko/status/2122293035815866605"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2122291262451494912"]}, "author_id": "1661782254622846984", "created_at": "2026-11-16T11:30:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122291282055729269"], "id": "2122291282055729269", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "41 minutos de fala e 12 links viraram rascunhos durante a noite com o Grok Bot. Segundo o relato, 6 agentes dividiram a preparação de cortes, posts e newsletter. Nada foi publicado: a aprovação continuou com o autor. https://t.co/eQBMM3go2k", "url": "https://x.com/thedoomguy_ai/status/2122291282055729269"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122289099507699712"]}, "author_id": "1380213498702135300", "created_at": "2026-11-16T11:23:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122289325400355147"], "id": "2122289325400355147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 1041, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119442033769136299", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "IF I F*CKING LOST MY IPHONE TOMORROW, I’D LOSE MY MONEY, MY EMAIL, MY TEXTS AND 11 YEARS OF PHOTOS.\n\nGROK BOT FIXED ALL OF IT. MY PART TOOK 3 MINUTES.\n\nI never checked how much of my life sits on one phone. Turns out: all of it.\n\nI gave Grok Bot one job: find everything I’d lose https://t.co/8qfdB79K5l https://t.co/EL7AEYdkoO", "url": "https://x.com/ScottyBeamIO/status/2122289325400355147"}, {"article": {"title": "One Chat, Every Machine"}, "author_id": "1991851893803610114", "created_at": "2026-11-16T11:13:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122286947280245065"], "id": "2122286947280245065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/STPBj6xGry", "url": "https://x.com/Agentik_os/status/2122286947280245065"}, {"author_id": "2118599155119755264", "created_at": "2026-11-16T10:55:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122282522939699292"], "id": "2122282522939699292", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2108930573431422976", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122201403510657524", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vivsnme Listed rent is rarely the real number once utilities, fees and the deposit go on top. I just built a small site for trying out different Grok Bot skills, and one of them lines rentals up side by side. Still early, feedback welcome: https://t.co/8GF5NdXx6G", "url": "https://x.com/Nicoyangbgc/status/2122282522939699292"}, {"author_id": "309036012", "created_at": "2026-11-16T10:42:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122279163054977457"], "id": "2122279163054977457", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122164224382447808", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot @xai We run our business on Grok Bot. Our bots handle bookings, enquiries, inboxes and the calendar, and they've stopped at 98% of our weekly limit. We want to upgrade our team to Ultra, but there's no option for it in Billing. Ticket T-K34627. Please help us upgrade today.", "url": "https://x.com/Kyhala/status/2122279163054977457"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122276453345550336"]}, "author_id": "2037006037501284352", "created_at": "2026-11-16T10:32:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122276501865259073"], "id": "2122276501865259073", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 1535,